        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Leigh Bardugo (the author of "
            },
            {
              "text": "Shadow and Bone) ",
              "italic": true
            },
            {
              "text": "talks about the creation of the show, and how it collected her multiverse of characters, and implemented plot-lines from each story. The show represented the Grishaverse, which was Leigh's story world for "
            },
            {
              "text": "Six of Crows",
              "italic": true
            },
            {
              "text": " and"
            },
            {
              "italic": true,
              "text": " Shadow and Bone"
            },
            {
              "text": ". Through the show, she was able to have the characters interact early on, which would help set up a crossover in future seasons."
            }
          ]
        }
